Map data attribution
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Gable's routing and geocoding features can call OpenRouteService (VROOM route
optimization + the Pelias geocoder) and can render maps with Leaflet. Data
served through those tools is derived from OpenStreetMap and related open
datasets. Any deployment that displays this data MUST preserve the required
attribution, including at minimum:

  © OpenStreetMap contributors — Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0

Pelias additionally blends sources published under Creative Commons Attribution
(CC-BY) terms (e.g. GeoNames, Who's on First). See THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md for
the full attribution requirements.
